      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You're right that the rot must be cut out to save the tree, but you don't have to do it alone or by staying in that position. The pain you're feeling is a signal that you need to step away from the family to protect yourself, not to destroy them. Letting go of the guilt is the only way to stop the bleeding, so please consider that leaving is actually the most loving thing you can do for everyone involved.",
